  <p>
    <strong>Now:</strong> use AI to speed up transcript coding and first drafts, and check every number against the source table before it goes in a report. <strong>Later:</strong> as tools improve, the paid work moves to judgment: bias checks, fieldwork, and standing behind a finding in front of a court, bank or funder.
  </p>

